  "description": {
    "text": "The Metagross deck of Expert Deck Leafeon VS Metagross +Online, released on 20 November 2009: two strong 60-card decks that need no changes to compete, the Leafeon deck dealing big damage by inflicting Special Conditions and the Metagross deck damaging every one of the opponent's Pokémon. Each has four holo cards, and the set has Trainer cards found nowhere else. The box also held a CD-ROM and an access number for Pokémon Card Game Online, the first way to play the card game against other people over the internet, ranked and with a friend list.",
    "sources": [
      {
